UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"I retained Clifford Andrew Sukhai of CAS Law for a civil matter. His advice was clear and practical, and the process was efficient, deliberately strategic, and well organized. I would recommend Clifford to anyone looking for solution-focused counsel.” Donald Blumer Entrepreneur/Business Owner","author":"","url":"https://caslaw.ca/"},{"text":"Clifford supported us with our corporate and contractual matters. He was consistently responsive and helped us turn legal considerations into practical business decisions. I would recommend him to companies looking for straightforward, business-minded counsel.” Warren Hall CFO, LOK Energy Services Inc","author":"","url":"https://caslaw.ca/"},{"text":"Mr. Sukhai’s professional legal services made decision-making straightforward. He is a strong proponent of being proactive rather than reactive, which helped us stay ahead of issues. I would recommend him to entrepreneurs who value clarity and solid legal foundations.” Henok Msghina Director, Habesha Pro","author":"","url":"https://caslaw.ca/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'caslaw-calgary' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"Avi worked with my wife and I to develop wills that reflect accurately our final wishes. The entire experience was handled with kindness, compassion and sincerity on his part. We realize wills and powers of attorney are sensitive issues to which one must attend and our recommendation of Avi is heartfelt and true.” Google Reviewer","author":"","url":"https://charneylegal.ca/"},{"text":"Avi Charney was excellent to deal with when my husband and I purchased our first home. His use of modern technology helped us sign paperwork and transfer funds easily…” Google Reviewer","author":"","url":"https://charneylegal.ca/"},{"text":"Charney Legal is the best Real Estate legal services corporation I had the pleasure of doing Business with. Mr. Charney was professional, knowledgeable & efficient.” Google Reviewer","author":"","url":"https://charneylegal.ca/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'charney-legal-toronto' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"I’m so happy to finally receive my eCOPR today! I couldn’t have done it without the incredible support of Max and Lisa. They are truly professional, knowledgeable, and dedicated. Throughout the entire immigration process, they were always patient, responsive, and provided clear guidance every step of the way.","author":"","url":"https://chaudharylaw.com/"},{"text":"My case was ultimately successful with the outstanding help and representation provided by Loughlin, and the result has had a life-changing impact on both me and my family. I sincerely thank him for helping me through one of the most difficult periods of my life.","author":"","url":"https://chaudharylaw.com/"},{"text":"I had a very pleasant experience with Chaudhary Law Office. Loughlin was my lawyer taking care of my case. Loughlin works well and works hard! He is very professional and a great lawyer! I am very happy with Loughlin. I also want to say Thank you to Lisa for her great work! This law office is a trustful law firm.","author":"","url":"https://chaudharylaw.com/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'chaudhary-law-office-north-york' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"The team at Clark & Clark have always been fantastic. They''ve helped us process four different home sales/purchases and always communicate effectively and get our information processed quickly. We have especially enjoyed working with their paralegal, Amy! She is incredibly thorough and very responsive.","author":"","url":"https://clarklegal.com/"},{"text":"I felt confident that Maxwell and Amy had my best interest at heart. They walked me through all the documentation, ensuring that I understood everything we were dealing with; while encouraging me to ask questions about anything that I did not understand.","author":"","url":"https://clarklegal.com/"},{"text":"Care and attention and simplifying what needed to be done and at the same time making sure the instructions were clear and that time was of the essence was understood. The deal is not done until it’s done. There was no coasting. As a client I felt I was a part of the team that lead to a successful closure.","author":"","url":"https://clarklegal.com/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'clark-and-clark-lawyers-calgary' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"From the first day that I met Alastair, he was friendly and I explained my situation and the strategy for winning our Spousal Sponsorship Appeal. He told me that money is not the focus and he only wanted to know the issues.","author":"","url":"https://www.clarkeimmigrationlaw.ca/"},{"text":"My husband is coming to Canada! Thank you for helping is with the Spousal Sponsorship Appeal at the tribunal. I can’t wait to tell everyone who needs an immigration lawyer, that I found a great one! I will refer them to you. 100% percent sure! You did such a good job! Thank you very much!","author":"","url":"https://www.clarkeimmigrationlaw.ca/reviews/"},{"text":"Alastair, your hard work is greatly appreciated. I’ve sent the payment via Paypal, fee included. I would make the wait and going through all the preparation all over again for the success we had on this case. Thank you, Alastair. I really will get my Christmas in Canada, and much more.","author":"","url":"https://www.clarkeimmigrationlaw.ca/reviews/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'clarke-immigration-law-winnipeg' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"I highly recommend Amedeo Clivio, after many visits to different lawyers and many negatives found along the way, Amedeo saw what many did not, he took the reins of my case which ended in success. His preparation, empathy and commitment to his work is indisputable. For which I will always be grateful. Diana Vivas","author":"","url":"https://www.cliviolaw.com/"},{"text":"I was extremely impressed with everything. I wanted to leave this comment to give special thanks to my lawyer, Meera. From the beginning to the end of my PR process, she patiently answered all my questions instantly. She was very friendly in every meeting. She managed my whole process perfectly with his knowledge and professionalism.","author":"","url":"https://www.cliviolaw.com/"},{"text":"I am extremely satisfied with Clivio’s services. Ever since the beginning, of our process me and my husband were in different countries, me in Canada and him in El Salvador.","author":"","url":"https://www.cliviolaw.com/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'clivio-law-professional-corporation-toronto' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
