UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐I got my friend’s doubts cleared here, and the experience was excellent! The staff was very helpful, friendly, and professional. Everything was explained clearly, and my friend was really satisfied with the service. Highly recommended!","author":"","url":"https://www.dietrichlaw.ca/"},{"text":"Dietrich Law Office was so great to work with over the last couple of years. They not only made a very hard time, easier, but they''re communication, staff and work was amazing. I would recommend their office to anyone in need of assistance during a hard time.","author":"Jenna G.","url":"https://www.dietrichlaw.ca/"},{"text":"Wonderful very helpful and made me happy with all results 5 Testimonial by S. F. on 2026-10-07T14:55:56-04:00","author":"","url":"https://www.dietrichlaw.ca/testimonials"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'dietrich-law-office-kitchener' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"We had a wonderful experience with Diversitas Law Group for our permanent residence application. Selvin Mejia handled our case with professionalism, expertise, and kindness, and was always available to answer all our questions and help us with every step along the way.","author":"","url":"https://www.dlawgroup.ca/"},{"text":"Diversitas Law Group helped me with my permanent residence and made the entire process easy and seamless. Selvin made us feel supported at every step of the way and went above and beyond to help us throughout the process. I highly recommend them! Maria Carolina Lasso","author":"","url":"https://www.dlawgroup.ca/"},{"text":"I sought an immigration advice from Ahmad Barzak, and he was brilliant. He helped my wife and I so much in obtaining my work permit and her visitor visa. I seriously cannot be more grateful for such knowledgeable and professional lawyer! Omar Anwar","author":"","url":"https://www.dlawgroup.ca/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'diversitas-law-group-london' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"Nothing but good things to say about Mr Dolgin. He worked hard to get me through a difficult divorce. He was conscious of budget and did his best to avoid unnecessary expenses. He was very sharp presenting arguments in court and I was impressed with his knowledge. I’d highly recommend him.","author":"","url":"https://dolginfamilylaw.ca/reviews/"},{"text":"I used the family law legal services of Jeremy Dolgin to represent me in a very long drawn out contentious separation and divorce case. Of the 4 lawyers and firms used over a 4 year period it was only the skills of Mr.","author":"","url":"https://dolginfamilylaw.ca/reviews/"},{"text":"I would recommend Jeremy Dolgin to anyone who requires a family lawyer. Jeremy wasted no time in creating a game plan to ensure we pick the right legal battles in the most cost efficient manner.","author":"","url":"https://dolginfamilylaw.ca/reviews/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'dolgin-family-law-ottawa' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"I spoke to Phil and he helped me through a legal situation in which I was scared, he provided excellent advice and a sense of comfort through the situation that I was so unfamiliar with.","author":"","url":"https://dominioncd.com/"},{"text":"Phillip Dinis is the man! I came in with my problem and he had no problem sitting down for an hour and a half long phone call, tending to my concerns. He understood my situation and walked me through every single step, informed me of my rights and what to do in detail in all scenarios.","author":"","url":"https://dominioncd.com/testimonials/"},{"text":"This entire team is ABSOLUTELY AMAZING! Hands down the BEST! Phillip and Christina are so full of knowledge and talent! I have been dealing with this firm for the past year and a half and today, I won my case. 👏 From the first day I reached out until now the whole team has been so great with me!","author":"","url":"https://dominioncd.com/testimonials/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'dominion-criminal-defence-london' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"Honestly I wish there was more stars to check ! Tim and his team are absolutely amazing by far! The predicament I had myself in basically would have ruined me and my life for a long time but through there negotiations and experience Tim got me the best outcome I could possibly get!","author":"","url":"https://www.dunlapcriminaldefencelawyer.com/"},{"text":"We are very thankful that we contacted and used Mr Dunlap to defend our son. All charges were dropped and no record. He was there for us when ever we needed a question answered. It was along 3 years but we are very grateful that he was the lawyer that we used. Thank you again so very much!!","author":"","url":"https://www.dunlapcriminaldefencelawyer.com/"},{"text":"Can not express how very greatfull my family and I are for your time and dedication to my sons defense. Today we were Not Guilty. Thank you soo so so much!!","author":"","url":"https://www.dunlapcriminaldefencelawyer.com/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'dunlap-criminal-defence-lawyer-edmonton-edmonton' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
