UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"The child support calculator provided on line through this firm is awesome. We have a long standing support agreement and we use this annually to update the child support amounts based on our T4''s.Thank you for providing this great tool online which allows you lawyers to focus on cases that really require your help rather than simple accounting annually for…","author":"","url":"https://www.calgaryfamilylaw.ca/"},{"text":"Excellent support payment calculator!! Thank you for making something so hard, so easy online. It has taken me along time to ask for help after what I have been through.\" Spousal support calculator user","author":"","url":"https://www.calgaryfamilylaw.ca/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'fraese-aymont-family-lawyers-calgary-calgary' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"Mathais was great to work with! He listened to all my wishes, crafted a marriage agreement that required zero revisions , and took the time to explain all the legal speak so that I fully understood everything that went into the agreement. The entire process was quick, seamless, and easy.","author":"","url":"https://freedomfamilylaw.ca/"},{"text":"Mathais was excellent from start to finish. He took the time to understand my situation, explained everything clearly, and answered all my questions without ever making me feel rushed. He''s sharp, professional, and genuinely easy to work with. He made a stressful process feel manageable , and I always felt like I was in good hands. Highly recommend.","author":"","url":"https://freedomfamilylaw.ca/"},{"text":"Mathais Sarrazin is incredibly professional, patient, fair and transparent . He went above and beyond for me and was incredibly efficient and responsive. If you''re in BC and come across his law practice, proceed. There''s a reason for the positive reviews! Thank you.","author":"","url":"https://freedomfamilylaw.ca/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'freedom-family-law' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"A few years ago I observed Mrs Mash Frouhar in action during a court trial. I was so impressed at how brilliant she is. I approached her for a business card just in case I needed a very good lawyer in the future. A few years later she got me out on bail.","author":"","url":"https://frouharlaw.com/"},{"text":"Connie D’Angelo of Frouhar Law did outstanding work counselling and representing me for my case. I couldn’t have found a better lawyer and firm. From the initial meeting all the way through to the final trial date Connie represented nothing but the highest degree professionalism.","author":"","url":"https://frouharlaw.com/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'frouhar-law-ottawa' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"He took a lot of weight off our shoulders by actively following up with immigration, guiding us and keeping us up to date throughout the case. I would highly recommend him to anyone going through the process.","author":"","url":"https://sponsorshipattorney.ca/"},{"text":"Nous tenons sincèrement à exprimer notre gratitude. Votre patience a été remarquable et vous avez pris le temps de nous guider à chaque étape de notre demande de parrainage. Merci infiniment.","author":"","url":"https://sponsorshipattorney.ca/"},{"text":"Très professionnel, à l''écoute et toujours disponible pour répondre à nos questions. Notre dossier de parrainage s''est conclu avec succès grâce à son expertise. Je recommande sans hésitation.","author":"","url":"https://sponsorshipattorney.ca/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'gad-pariente-montreal' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"Just a note following your letter dated July 1. You’re so kind Stan to \u0003\"contribute\" to the resolution of what has become a nearly disastrously \u0003unhappy chapter in our lives… Read Full Review","author":"","url":"https://www.galbraith.ab.ca/"},{"text":"My wife and I had our Wills done at Galbraith Law and found the service, thoroughness and price to be excellent. We highly recommend Galbraith Law for your legal needs. Definitely 5 stars…","author":"","url":"https://www.galbraith.ab.ca/about-us/testimonials/"},{"text":"Alisha was very efficient and got my key documents done professionally in much less time than I’d ever imagined. Well done and thanks for everything Galbraith!!","author":"","url":"https://www.galbraith.ab.ca/about-us/testimonials/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'galbraith-law-edmonton' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"We had an outstanding experience with Gail Law. The entire team was professional, supportive, and incredibly knowledgeable . A special thank you to Kim Gale, Palak, and Jessica each of you played a key role in making the process smooth and stress-free. Your clear communication, attention to detail, and dedication truly made a difference.","author":"","url":"https://galelaw.ca/"},{"text":"My wife and I have retained Kim and her team for four years and highly recommend the firm. A highlight: Kim and her team pursued a client of my wife that owed her $125,000 in fees. The client was living in Europe and very hard to find.","author":"","url":"https://galelaw.ca/"},{"text":"Incredibly grateful to everyone at Gale Law for assisting me with a small claims legal matter. Special thanks to Jessica as she worked with me specifically on my case. All interactions with her were very pleasant. Jessica responded to my emails quickly and answered my questions thoroughly.","author":"","url":"https://galelaw.ca/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'gale-law-professional-corporation-toronto' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"N.H. Client Reviews I’m so grateful for Ian, he truly cares about his clients. He’s as real as it gets. It’s nice to see a lawyer who’s passionate for the best outcome for his client. I can’t recommend this place enough!","author":"","url":"https://mineslaw.com/testimonials/"},{"text":"A.L. Client Reviews A huge thanks to Michael Mines for getting this criminal charge brought to a fair and appropriate conclusion with a criminal charge being dropped. Michael knows his profession and is well versed in criminal law to seek the best possible outcome for an individual like me, who at 77 years, simply made an honest mistake.","author":"","url":"https://mineslaw.com/testimonials/"},{"text":"I.A. Client Reviews Ian Gauthier helped me on my case recently, he is very knowledgeable and patient, provided me with wise advices with his professional expertise.He always answers me quickly and professionally with right guidance to move in positive direction.","author":"","url":"https://mineslaw.com/testimonials/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'gauthier-and-mines-criminal-lawyers-vancouver' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"J''ai été très bien épaulée et conseillée tout au long du processus. Maître Gauthier a été humaine et à l''écoute.","author":"","url":"https://avocatsgauthier.com/"},{"text":"Bonjour, Me Sophie Gauthier m''a été référé en juin dernier. Je suis très reconnaissant de son professionnalisme, de son écoute et de son grand côté humain à vouloir que je sois respecter dans le mise en demeure que j''ai reçue. Sincèrement Nelson Vallée","author":"","url":"https://avocatsgauthier.com/"},{"text":"J''ai été très bien servis par ce bureau. J''ai eu l''heure juste sur l''état de ma situation. Mon dossier c''est réglé sans encombre. Merci. Je recommande!","author":"","url":"https://avocatsgauthier.com/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'gauthier-avocats-brossard' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"Evan Clemence supported our family through one of the most stressful and difficult periods of our lives, and it was an absolute blessing to have him as our lawyer. He made me and the kids feel safe and steady through the chaos of an incredibly stressful and complicated divorce.","author":"","url":"https://lisagelman.com/"},{"text":"Both Sierra and Rosalia were most helpful during our engagement and provided excellent customer service.","author":"","url":"https://lisagelman.com/"},{"text":"I had the greatest experience working with Jake Sandler and Alexis Wilson for a family law case! Jake was clear, responsive, and incredibly knowledgeable- but beyond that, he brought a level of calm and professionalism that made a stressful situation much more manageable. He went above and beyond throughout the process.","author":"","url":"https://lisagelman.com/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'gelman-and-associates' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"George Lee is a responsible, knowledgeable, and supportive family lawyer who genuinely cares about his clients. Throughout my case, he patiently explained the litigation process and guided me through family law while always encouraging me to focus on the best interests of my child and to remain a caring mother.","author":"","url":"https://gleelaw.com/testimonials/"},{"text":"I had a very positive experience working with George Lee and his team. George was professional and clear in his communication throughout the process. He explained my options and handled the matter with competence and care. His staff were also friendly and easy to communicate with, which made the process smoother.","author":"","url":"https://gleelaw.com/testimonials/"},{"text":"Thank you for your outstanding support and professionalism. Your guidance, patience, and expertise helped me achieve a positive outcome, and I truly appreciate everything you have done for me. I highly recommend your services.","author":"","url":"https://gleelaw.com/testimonials/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'george-lee-law-corp-burnaby' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
